{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/wallpaper_machick.png?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Magic fights back in\u00a0Machick 2.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\ud83d\udc14\u00a0The anti-magic toads have returned\u2014stronger, stranger, and ready to wipe out\u00a0magic once and for all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/Watertrapsdangerouszone.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash the ancient and unlimited... Power!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up by defeating enemies and collecting XP orbs, unlocking new spells or evolving existing ones into bigger, crazier versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/Galaxies.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build the wands that will tear the toads apart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a magical chicken wielding ancient power and the knowledge to craft your own wands from parts like\u00a0<strong>wood</strong>,\u00a0<strong>core</strong>,\u00a0<strong>shape</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>element</strong>. Each choice changes how your spells behave and look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/Wandcraft.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather the gear of the greater ones!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, find relics and magical accessories that change your build and strategy. Also, you can summon enchanted chicks to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/Relics_Room.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>A kiss is not gonna help with this...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">they curse, explode, vanish, and swarm in unpredictable ways. Your fight only gets harder the deeper you go. Fight and defeat the dangerous bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/Boss.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The toads have grown more dangerous!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With vibrant pixel art, explosive effects, and a ton of magic,\u00a0<strong>Machick 2</strong>\u00a0is a roguelike full of surprises where you create your own story in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/extras/ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1747529413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magic isn\u2019t gone\u2014 it just turned into Machick!.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449040?t=1747529413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/0ee3941f4b5afca5b3ddb0e28f8ecfd506dac9b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747529413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/50d40b3c3ada8f13ae782759bfc98515be0ffd56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747529413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449040/50d40b3c3ada8f13ae782759bfc98515be0ffd56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747529413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3451050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"